                                                     2 ***********************************************************************
                                                     3 *
                                                     4 *    Zvector E7 instruction tests for VRR-c encoded:
                                                     5 *
                                                     6 *        E7B0 VDL    - VECTOR DIVIDE LOGICAL
                                                     7 *        E7B1 VRL    - VECTOR REMAINDER LOGICAL
                                                     8 *        E7B2 VD     - VECTOR DIVIDE
                                                     9 *        E7B3 VR     - VECTOR REMAINDER
                                                    10 *
                                                    11 *    and partial testing of
                                                    12 *
