                                                    16 *
                                                    17 *        James Wekel March 2026
                                                    18 ***********************************************************************


                                                    20 ***********************************************************************
                                                    21 *
                                                    22 *        basic instruction tests
                                                    23 *
                                                    24 ***********************************************************************
                                                    25 *  This program tests proper functioning of the z/arch E7 VRR-c
                                                    26 *  Vector Divide Logical, Vector Remainder Logical, Vector Divide,
                                                    27 *  and Vector Remainder instructions.
                                                    28 *
                                                    29 *  Exceptions are not tested.
                                                    30 *
                                                    31 *  PLEASE NOTE that the tests are very SIMPLE TESTS designed to catch
                                                    32 *  obvious coding errors.  None of the tests are thorough.  They are
                                                    33 *  NOT designed to test all aspects of any of the instructions.
                                                    34 *
                                                    35 ***********************************************************************
                                                    36 *
                                                    37 *    *Testcase zvector-e7-30-DivideRem
                                                    38 *    *
                                                    39 *    *   Zvector E7 instruction tests for VRR-c encoded:
                                                    40 *    *
                                                    41 *    *   E7B0 VDL    - VECTOR DIVIDE LOGICAL
                                                    42 *    *   E7B1 VRL    - VECTOR REMAINDER LOGICAL
                                                    43 *    *   E7B2 VD     - VECTOR DIVIDE
                                                    44 *    *   E7B3 VR     - VECTOR REMAINDER
                                                    45 *    *
                                                    46 *    *
                                                    47 *    *   # ------------------------------------------------------------
                                                    48 *    *   #  This tests only the basic function of the instructions.
                                                    49 *    *   #  Exceptions are NOT tested.
                                                    50 *    *   # ------------------------------------------------------------
                                                    51 *    *
                                                    52 *    mainsize    2
                                                    53 *    numcpu      1
                                                    54 *    sysclear
                                                    55 *    archlvl     z/Arch
                                                    56 *
