                                                   123 ***********************************************************************
                                                   124 *     Instruction Macros
                                                   125 ***********************************************************************
                                                   126 ***********************************************************************
                                                   127 * (pending E7B0 VDL    - VECTOR DIVIDE LOGICAL
                                                   128 *  inclusion in SATK ASAM)
                                                   129 *
                                                   130 *     VDL Macro to help build VDL instruction
                                                   131 *        VDL   m4, m5
                                                   132 *
                                                   133 *        Note: v1, v2, v3 are fixed vector registers:
                                                   134 *                         v1 = 1; v2 = 2, v3 = 3
                                                   135 *              m4 are specified in hex eg. x'0'
                                                   136 *              m5 are specified in hex eg. x'0'
                                                   137 ***********************************************************************
                                                   138          MACRO
                                                   139          VDL   &M4,&M5
                                                   140 .*                                     &M4  - m4 for VDL instruction
                                                   141 .*                                     &M5  - m5 for VDL instruction
                                                   142          LCLA  &M4M5
                                                   143 &M4M5    SETA  +((+&M5*256)+(+&M4*16))
                                                   144                                                                SPACE 1
                                                   145          DS    0H                      E7B0 VDL
                                                   146          DC    X'E7'                   - VECTOR DIVIDE LOGICAL
                                                   147          DC    X'12'                    v1, v2
                                                   148          DC    X'30'                    v3, reserved
                                                   149          DC    HL2'&M4M5'               reserved, m5, m4, RXB
                                                   150          DC    X'B0'
                                                   151                                                                SPACE 1
                                                   152          MEND


                                                   154 ***********************************************************************
                                                   155 * (pending E7B1 VRL    - VECTOR REMAINDER LOGICAL
                                                   156 *  inclusion in SATK ASAM)
