                                                   163 *              m4 are specified in hex eg. x'0'
                                                   164 *              m5 are specified in hex eg. x'0'
                                                   165 ***********************************************************************
                                                   166          MACRO
                                                   167          VRL   &M4,&M5
                                                   168 .*                                     &M4  - m4 for VRL instruction
                                                   169 .*                                     &M5  - m5 for VRL instruction
